        "TileImage": "$($repository c4d3d686-04d2-492f-ae09-25291e71eb06).Image",
        "Description": "Good day, 47.\r\rWe have received a high-priority contract from an anonymous shareholder within the GAMA medical group. A rogue faction within the facility is orchestrating a highly illegal, black-market organ smuggling ring, using terminally ill patients as non-consenting donors.\r\rTo protect the integrity of the medical institution and bring justice to the victims, you are tasked with eliminating four key individuals responsible for managing, financing, and protecting this operation.",
